
Darkness...floating...nothingness...

You struggle to grasp at a recurring thought in your mind, but as you 
get close, it vanishes. You can't remember what it was, or better yet,
who you are...

Out of the darkness comes a voice, speaking to you softly in a
familiar tongue.

'Welcome friend, the time is almost upon us and we must prepare you
for it. You must free your mind and focus only on the question at
hand, for within the question lies your fate...'


